  <MissileTypes>
    <MissileTemplate>
      <Designation>CM-400</Designation>
      <Nickname>Container</Nickname>
      <Description>DIRECT - &lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;CMD&lt;/color&gt;/ARAD(&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;)/ACT(&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;) - NUKE FUZE</Description>
      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;CM-400 Container&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 4 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the CM-4 body, which is a heavy anti-ship torpedo.  This missile will deliver a Proximity Fuze, Nuclear Warhead warhead.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship  If the primary seeker does not find a target or is jammed, it can fall back on a Radar Anti-Radiation seeker or an Active Radar seeker.

Control Method: DIRECT
Targeting Modes: &lt;b&gt;&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;POSITION&lt;/color&gt;	&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;TRACK&lt;/color&gt;&lt;/b&gt;

Primary Seeker: COMMAND (&lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;Requires COMMS Enabled&lt;/color&gt;)
Backup Seeker: ANTI-RADIATION (All &lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt; Signals)
Backup Seeker: ACTIVE &lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;

Speed: 125 m/s
Distance: 5,783 m
Top Speed In: 0.9 s
Turn Rate: 3.0 G
Terminal Maneuvers: Corkscrew
(&lt;color=#D3D11F&gt;May decrease effective range&lt;/color&gt;)

Warhead: Proximity Fuze, Nuclear Warhead
Armor: 1.19cm
Component: 0hp
Fuze Distance: 443 m
Blast
  Radius: 4,434 m
  Component Damage at Center: 665,073 m
EMP
  Signature Type: &lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;RADAR&lt;/color&gt;
  Range: 10,643 m
  Radiated Power: 7,390 kW
  Gain: 1 dB

Body Integrity: 150 
Wall Thickness: 0.2
Programming Time: 20 s
Radar Signature Bonus: 100 %
Boost-Phase Duration: 3 s
Boost-Phase Strafe: 100 %
Boost-Phase Turn Rate: 100 %
Failure Rate: 0 %</LongDescription>
      <Cost>1192</Cost>
      <BodyKey>Stock/CM-4 Body</BodyKey>
      <TemplateKey>93004562-6704-42b5-b6e9-e11d2d3f2c66</TemplateKey>
      <BaseColor>
        <r>0</r>
        <g>0</g>
        <b>0</b>
        <a>1</a>
      </BaseColor>
      <StripeColor>
        <r>0</r>
        <g>0</g>
        <b>0</b>
        <a>1</a>
      </StripeColor>
      <Sockets>
        <MissileSocket>
          <Size>1</Size>
          <InstalledComponent xsi:type="CommandSeekerSettings">
            <ComponentKey>Stock/Command Receiver</ComponentKey>
            <Mode>Targeting</Mode>
            <RejectUnvalidated>false</RejectUnvalidated>
          </InstalledComponent>
        </MissileSocket>
        <MissileSocket>
          <Size>1</Size>
          <InstalledComponent xsi:type="PassiveARHSeekerSettings">
